# XNPV: net present value of a dated (non-periodic) cash-flow schedule.
# Flows in A1:A5, Excel serial dates in B1:B5 (2008-01-01 … 2009-04-01).
INPUT A1 -10000
INPUT A2 2750
INPUT A3 4250
INPUT A4 3250
INPUT A5 2750
INPUT B1 39448
INPUT B2 39508
INPUT B3 39751
INPUT B4 39859
INPUT B5 39904
INPUT C1 =XNPV(0.09, A1:A5, B1:B5)
CHECKNUM C1 2086.6476

# Rate <= -1 has no valid discount factor -> #NUM!
INPUT C2 =XNPV(-2, A1:A5, B1:B5)
CHECKERR C2 #NUM!
